  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Data Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This award will improve consistency in the collection of humanitarian data by establishing a service desk to support the global rollout of a new data platform. A self-paced, e-training module will be developed to educate partners and staff on how to properly collect data and gain access to generate reports. Once phase 2 activities complete, the platform will be used to identify training gaps and deliver real-time, needs-based training to improve the data literacy of local partners and staff. Additionally, regional and global data trends will be used to support evidence-based policy advocacy, refine knowledge management planning, and improve communication within the humanitarian sector.</narrative>
  </description>
